# Academic knowledge graph — a rich, coherent ontology for the playground.
#
# Classes (6): Researcher, Paper, Institution, Journal, Topic, Grant  (+ City)
# Object properties (11): authored, affiliatedWith, advisedBy, coauthor,
#   publishedIn, cites, hasTopic, fundedBy, awardedTo, locatedIn, subTopicOf
# Data properties: foaf:name, ex:orcid, ex:hIndex, dcterms:title, dcterms:date,
#   ex:doi, ex:citationCount, ex:country, ex:founded, ex:issn, ex:impactFactor,
#   rdfs:label, ex:amount, ex:agency, ex:issn.
#
# Vocab: rdf:type, foaf:name, rdfs:label, dcterms:title/date, ex:* domain terms.

# ============================ Cities (3) ============================
